# .claude/

# Purpose

- Claude Code configuration for this workspace: its own skills, hooks, and settings. The convention hooks and `conventions-audit` are user-level (`~/conventions`) and are not listed here.

# Skills

- [<skill-name>](skills/<skill-name>/SKILL.md) — <when this skill is invoked>.

# Hooks

- [hooks/<script>](hooks/<script>) — `<Event>`/`<matcher>` hook that <what it does>. Omit this section if the workspace has no hooks of its own.

# Settings

- [settings.json](settings.json) — checked-in configuration for this workspace's own hooks. Omit if there are none.
- [settings.local.json](settings.local.json) — local, per-user permission allowlist.

# Last Updated

- <YYYY-MM-DD> — update this date whenever this file is edited.
